<p>I put together a small <a href="https://www.devontechnologies.com/apps/devonthink">DEVONthink</a> script that publishes the Markdown notes you have selected to <a href="https://share.markedapp.com">Marked Share</a>. The notes stay private, and publishing one again updates the same document instead of making a second copy.</p>

